# bin/ and obj/ hold absolute paths from the machine that built them. Copying
# them into the image produces restore and build failures that look nothing
# like their cause. CI never sees them because .gitignore excludes them from
# the clone; a local `docker build` would, without this file.
**/bin/
**/obj/

**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user

.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.dockerignore

infra/
scripts/
README.md
*.http
appsettings.Development.json